{
 "The Accountant": "",
 "Every enemy carries a number above its head and you manipulate the numbers. At zero it collapses.": "",
 "Law Scribe": "",
 "Write a law over the area around you; everyone who enters it obeys.": "",
 "Distance Warper": "",
 "Bend the distance between you and anything: pull, push, swap and fold space.": "",
 "Echo Weaver": "",
 "Every action leaves an echo that returns a moment later and strikes again.": "",
 "Iron Body": "",
 "Harden your body like iron and strike with a heavy fist.": "",
 "Crystal Lord": "",
 "Grow sharp crystals: throw them, armor up with them, imprison enemies, and detonate them.": "",
 "Trait Borrower": "",
 "Borrow a trait from nature (rock, fangs, wings, hunter's eye) and fuse two traits together.": "",
 "Wind Strider": "",
 "Speed, leaps and gales; move faster than any enemy.": "",
 "Star Sovereign": "",
 "Summon the stars: meteors, gravity, orbits, constellations and black holes, up to the Supernova that turns any battle.": "",
 "Number Seal": "",
 "Mark an enemy with the number 10. It drops by itself every 2 seconds and every hit lowers it; at zero it collapses and takes damage.": "",
 "Subtract": "",
 "Lower an enemy's number by 3 (if unmarked, marks it with 7).": "",
 "Transfer": "",
 "Move an enemy's number to the nearest other enemy.": "",
 "Iron Skin": "",
 "Your body hardens: high resistance for 6 seconds.": "",
 "Iron Fist": "",
 "A heavy punch to the enemy in front of you: high damage and knockback.": "",
 "Wind Run": "",
 "High speed for 5 seconds with a wind trail.": "",
 "Wind Leap": "",
 "Leap forward with force and land softly.": "",
 "Gale": "",
 "A gale that pushes and hurts every nearby enemy.": "",
 "Divide": "",
 "Split an enemy's number in two: half stays, half goes to the nearest other enemy (if unmarked, starts from 10).": "",
 "Zero": "",
 "If the enemy's number is 5 or less it collapses instantly, otherwise lowers it by 5.": "",
 "Law of Weight": "",
 "A circle that greatly slows enemies, stops them from jumping and hurts them every second.": "",
 "Law of Silence": "",
 "Archers inside the circle cannot shoot and every enemy hits weaker.": "",
 "Law of Reflection": "",
 "Any hit you take inside the circle is thrown back at the attacker.": "",
 "Law of Boundary": "",
 "Enemies inside the circle cannot leave it.": "",
 "Law of Time": "",
 "Enemies around you freeze for 3 seconds.": "",
 "Absolute Law": "",
 "Choose a law that lasts 5 seconds.": "",
 "Pull": "",
 "The enemy is yanked to you without walking.": "",
 "Push": "",
 "Throw the enemy far away without touching it.": "",
 "Swap": "",
 "Swap places with the enemy.": "",
 "Fold": "",
 "Fold the distance and strike the enemy as if they were beside you.": "",
 "Collapse": "",
 "All nearby enemies are gathered into a single point.": "",
 "Echo Strike": "",
 "Your next hit repeats after one second.": "",
 "Echo Seal": "",
 "Mark an enemy: all damage it takes is echoed back and explodes.": "",
 "Echo Wave": "",
 "A wave in front of you, followed by a second echo that strikes again.": "",
 "Echo Chorus": "",
 "Three echo waves expand around you, each stronger than the last.": "",
 "Spatial Rewind": "",
 "First use: saves your position for 15 seconds. Second use: return to that spot and recover some health.": "",
 "Crystal Shards": "",
 "Three shards where you look. While sneaking: one powerful crystal spear that pierces everything. Shards leave crystals on enemies.": "",
 "Crystal Shield": "",
 "Crystals orbit you and give you an absorption shield for 10 seconds.": "",
 "Crystal Prison": "",
 "Trap an enemy in crystals: frozen in place and weakened (bosses for a shorter time).": "",
 "Crystal Burst": "",
 "Detonate every crystal stuck on enemies. Each crystal deals damage and a small blast hits those around it.": "",
 "Rock Trait": "",
 "Borrow rock skin: high resistance and slight slowness.": "",
 "Fang Trait": "",
 "For 8 seconds your hits poison the enemy and heal you a little.": "",
 "Wing Trait": "",
 "High jump, slow fall and speed for 10 seconds.": "",
 "Hunter's Eye Trait": "",
 "Night vision and mark every nearby enemy; your hits on them are stronger.": "",
