 "Training Archer": "",
 "Unranked": "",
 "It draws when you come close and recoils as it shoots a violet-trailed arrow. It weakens up close, and the Law of Silence stops it from shooting.": "",
 "Ember Imp": "",
 "Lowly to Cataclysm": "",
 "Close: a red circle marks where it will pounce, then it rakes you with fiery claws. Far (7-13 blocks): it charges a fireball and lobs it; a red circle shows where it lands, so move!": "",
 "Rust Guard": "",
 "A red circle grows around it before its ground slam, so step out. Up close it sweeps with crystal fists. Far (6-14 blocks): it tears out a boulder and throws it; dodge the red circle.": "",
 "Shadow Hound": "",
 "It howls to slow you, bites twice up close, and from 4-10 blocks it melts into violet smoke and appears behind you to bite. Keep turning.": "",
 "Gloomhorn": "",
 "Grim to Cataclysm": "",
 "A spectral stag with an open ribcage and a floating heart. It scrapes the ground, then CHARGES and RAMS you with its antlers, so step aside. From afar its heart glows and a SPIRIT STAG bursts from its chest and gallops at you, followed by two more. Up close its heart BEATS three times: each beat sends a wave along the ground (JUMP over it), and the last one binds you with SOUL CHAINS that drain your life. Run more than 10 blocks to break them.": "",
 "Hollow Seer": "",
 "A floating seer with one round eye. When it raises its hand in front of the eye, an ORANGE BEAM gathers: the aim locks a moment before it fires, so sidestep. From 6-7 blocks away it lifts its arms and ROOTS erupt from the ground one after another toward you, then a CAGE OF ROOTS curls around you. Up close an ICE ORB forms before its face and it exhales a FROST BREATH: your screen freezes like powder snow and you slow down, but you can still fight.": "",
 "Veilfox": "",
 "A spirit fox with five flame-tipped tails and a white mask. FOXFIRE SERPENT: nine spirit flames weave toward you in a snaking train (stand between the waves). MIRROR CAROUSEL: it and three real shadow foxes circle you in a tightening ring, then all collapse on you at once (kill the shadows to thin it). SUN SHOWER: foxfire drops rain down over eight blocks around you. Below half health it casts MOON LIFT: it floats you into the air while three volleys of crescent waves fall on you.": "",
 "Magmamoth": "",
 "Vile to Cataclysm": "",
 "A volcanic mammoth, about 4 blocks tall on long legs, of armoured basalt and glowing magma cracks. FISSURE STOMP: a shock ring, then eight magma cracks race outward and burst one spot at a time (stand between the cracks). INFERNO SWEEP: from 7+ blocks away it raises its trunk and sweeps a real jet of flames from the trunk tip across you, leaving fire patches. TUSK STAMPEDE: it scrapes, charges, re-aims and charges again; whoever it catches is tossed by the tusks, and it leaves a trail of fire. VOLCANIC BOMBARDMENT: it hurls burning boulders high that arc down onto you. MAGMA ARMOR: its cracks blaze white-hot and it takes much less damage for nine seconds.": "",
 "Grey Bear": "",
 "A grey bear that fights standing on two legs, with a silver crescent on its chest and a clawed scar over one eye. BEAR HUG: it spreads its arms and grabs whoever is in front of it, squeezes three times and throws them; hit it 3 times or dash out to break free. RENDING CLAWS: four alternating claw swipes that scratch your body and make you bleed (stacks up to 3). CUB CALL: it roars and two cubs run at you and cling to your legs, slowing you; kill a cub and the bear goes into a rage. DEEP HIBERNATION: when hurt it falls asleep and heals; strike it and it wakes in a WRATH that blasts you away. Thick pelt: hits on its front do 30% less damage, hits on its back 20% more.": "",
 "Prayer Mantis": "",
 "Cursed to Cataclysm": "",
 "A leaf-green mantis with a long raised neck, glowing violet eyes and two folded scythe arms. It is very rare in the wild. PRAYER STANCE: a cursed halo rises behind its head and it raises both scythes; any hit you land is turned back at you DOUBLED as an X of blades, so wait it out or keep your distance. LEAF CAMOUFLAGE: a whirl of leaves and it turns half transparent, creeps close and stabs with both scythes; hit it to reveal it early. SCISSOR LOCK: two huge blades close around your waist and pin you for 1.5 s before a final snip; DASH to break it. MOLT: at half health it sheds its old shell, which explodes a moment later (run!), and the fresh mantis is faster and attacks more often.": "",
 "Hollow Harvester": "",
 "A cursed scarecrow that roams the world, a block and a quarter taller than you: a burlap sack head with violet eyes and a stitched grin, a straw hat, a torn coat, and a huge scythe in its hand. It moves in stiff, puppet-like jerks and is very rare in the wild. PUPPET STRINGS: from 4-15 blocks it points at you and a string shoots from its hand; a moment later it DRAGS you to it, so DASH to snap the string first. HOLLOW STARE: its head tilts and its eyes flare; if you are looking at it you are slowed (Slowness I only, no darkness), so look away. SEALING SCYTHE: up close it raises the scythe over its head and reaps in front of it; if it hits you, the skill or weapon in your hand is SEALED for 8 s (switch to another one). WEAKNESS: FIRE. Fire hurts it three times as much, and while it burns it flails and cannot use its skills. Very rarely it drops its scythe, the Harvester's Scythe: the only way to get one.": "",
 "Cursed Villager": "",
 "Curse": "",
 "Very rarely a villager near you is CURSED. Black marks spread over its body in three stages over about five minutes, and at the last stage its eyes glow violet. Then it convulses and TURNS into a monster of a random rank: most often Lowly, sometimes Grim, rarely Vile and very rarely Cursed. Defeat it before it turns to end the curse.": "",
 "Sand Scorpion": "",
 "Its tail spits a venom glob up close. From 5-12 blocks it burrows underground; a red circle locks under you before it erupts, poisoning and launching you.": "",
